{"title": "Keychron’s keyboards and dock are perfect desk accessories, and they’re up to $48 off", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/19/keychrons-keyboards-and-dock-deals-black-friday/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/11/Keychron-Thunderbolt-5-Dock-1.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A good keyboard is essential to a good desk setup, and a Thunderbolt 5 dock makes that setup feel much cleaner. Keychron’s keyboards and new dock are on sale with up to $48 off during the deal season.</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/19/keychrons-keyboards-and-dock-deals-black-friday/#more-738916\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-11-19T08:44:09+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-20T18:35:40.908876+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
{"title": "Proton Pass is up to 60% off for Black Friday—and it does way more than just store your passwords", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/19/proton-pass-is-up-to-60-off-for-black-friday-and-it-does-way-more-than-just-store-your-passwords-sponsored/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/11/lifestyle-laptop-pass-2048x1365-1.webp?w=1500\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">There’s a familiar interruption that comes with shopping online: you’ve found what you want, you’re ready to check out, and the store asks you to sign in. Was this the account with your usual password? Did you change it last time? Is it easier to reset it again?</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Proton Pass is designed to take that friction out of your day. It creates strong, unique passwords, remembers them for you, and fills them in when you log in. But it also handles something a password alone can’t: keeping your real email address out of another retailer’s database.</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/19/proton-pass-is-up-to-60-off-for-black-friday-and-it-does-way-more-than-just-store-your-passwords-sponsored/#more-737123\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-11-19T08:18:51+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-20T18:35:40.908876+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
{"title": "AI features could be turned off with a simple toggle, Canva proves", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/19/canva-ai-features-toggle/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/11/canva-ai-toggle-1.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1200\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">AI has taken over <em>everything</em> in the past few years, with AI features bombarding virtually every app or service available. If you’ve ever wanted to just turn off AI features, Canva proves that it <em>could</em> be a simple toggle, if companies actually wanted to give you a choice.</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/19/canva-ai-features-toggle/#more-738874\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-11-19T08:10:00+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-20T18:35:40.908876+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
